%% Sequence: ROI de Torneio Live (presencial) com Custos de Pacote
%% Spec: Docs/specs/tournament-types-extension-and-manual-add-fix.md (RF-11)
%% ADR-031: isLive modificador ortogonal - campos package_* opcionais

sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Jogador
    participant UI as TournamentLibraryNew.tsx
    participant Helper as shared/liveROI.ts (puro, sem query)
    participant Tournament as tournament row (carregado do storage)

    Note over User,Tournament: Helpers puros - chamados client-side e server-side<br/>(sem network/DB - operacao O(1))

    User->>UI: Visualiza torneio live "WSOP Main Event"
    UI->>Tournament: Carrega tournament (ja tem isLive=true + package_* preenchidos)

    UI->>Helper: getLiveTournamentTotalCost(tournament)

    alt isLive === false
        Helper-->>UI: Number(buyIn)
        Note over Helper: Apenas buy-in - custos package_* sao ignorados<br/>(refinement Zod garante que estao todos null)
    else isLive === true
        Helper->>Helper: cost = Number(buyIn ?? 0)<br/>+ Number(packageBuyIn ?? 0)<br/>+ Number(packageAccommodation ?? 0)<br/>+ Number(packageTravel ?? 0)<br/>+ Number(packageMeals ?? 0)<br/>+ Number(packageOther ?? 0)
        Helper-->>UI: cost (USD)

        Note over Helper,UI: Cada componente e opcional<br/>(usuario registra apenas o que quiser)<br/>Coalesce para 0 quando null
    end

    UI->>Helper: getLiveROI(tournament)
    Helper->>Helper: cost = getLiveTournamentTotalCost(tournament)

    alt cost === 0
        Helper-->>UI: 0
        Note over Helper: Evita div/0 quando buyIn=0 e nenhum pacote
    else cost > 0
        Helper->>Helper: prize = Number(tournament.prize ?? 0)<br/>roi = (prize - cost) / cost
        Helper-->>UI: roi (decimal, ex: 0.5 = 50% lucro, -0.3 = 30% prejuizo)
    end

    UI->>UI: Render card live com:<br/>- buyIn separado<br/>- packageBuyIn, packageAccommodation, packageTravel, packageMeals, packageOther (se preenchidos)<br/>- packageNotes (se preenchido)<br/>- Total Cost (helper output)<br/>- Prize<br/>- ROI live (%) calculado considerando custos
    UI-->>User: Visualizacao com ROI realista

    alt Combinacao com Coach Tournament Selector (RF-08)
        participant Scorer as server/scoring/tournamentScorer.ts
        participant Selector as Coach Tournament Selector

        Note over Scorer,Selector: Scoring usa Helper para calcular liveCostPenalty
        Selector->>Helper: getLiveTournamentTotalCost(template)
        Helper-->>Selector: sumPackage (excluindo buy-in)
        Selector->>Scorer: liveCostPenalty = -clamp((sumPackage / buyIn) * 5, 0, 15)
        Scorer-->>Selector: scoring ajustado<br/>(torneios live caros tem ROI menor por unidade de tempo)

        Note over Scorer: Razao da penalty:<br/>- Deslocamento (voo, transporte)<br/>- Dias de jogo (alimentacao, hospedagem)<br/>- Comparado a online: tempo investido e maior<br/>- Penalty proporcional ao custo total / buy-in
    end

    alt Analytics agregado /api/analytics/by-modifier
        participant Analytics as server/routes/analytics.ts
        participant DB as PostgreSQL

        Analytics->>DB: SELECT<br/>SUM(buy_in + COALESCE(package_buy_in,0) + COALESCE(package_accommodation,0) + COALESCE(package_travel,0) + COALESCE(package_meals,0) + COALESCE(package_other,0)) AS totalCost,<br/>SUM(prize) AS totalWon,<br/>COUNT(*) AS sampleSize<br/>FROM tournaments<br/>WHERE user_id=? AND is_live=true
        DB-->>Analytics: aggregateLive

        Analytics->>DB: SELECT SUM(buy_in) AS totalCost, SUM(prize) AS totalWon, COUNT(*) AS sampleSize<br/>FROM tournaments<br/>WHERE user_id=? AND is_live=false
        DB-->>Analytics: aggregateOnline

        Note over Analytics: ROI live considera todos os custos<br/>ROI online considera apenas buy-in<br/>Comparativo no dashboard "Live vs Online"

        Analytics-->>User: Cards comparativos no dashboard
    end

    Note over User,Helper: Edge case: Satelite reward=package + isLive=true<br/>Refinement Zod rejeita esta combinacao<br/>(rewardType=package implica satelite ONLINE dando pacote como premio;<br/>se satelite e presencial ganhando pacote, o pacote e do TARGET, nao do satelite)
